## Available Commands

### Development

- `mise run dev` - Start development mode with hot reload
- `mise run build` - Build all packages and apps
- `mise run clean` - Clean build artifacts

### Quality

- `mise run test` - Run all tests
- `mise run lint` - Lint all code
- `mise run check-types` - Type-check all TypeScript

### Tools

- `bun run <workspace-name> <script>` - Run a workspace script
- `turbo <task>` - Run a task across all workspaces

